<title>MALAYSIA: Pernas year to Jan 31, 1997 net up 87 pct.</title>
<headline>Pernas year to Jan 31, 1997 net up 87 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    79.18	  vs	 42.41</p>
<p>    Shr	  (cents)  17.7	   vs	 11.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)  19.0	   vs	  8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     681.88	  vs	211.84</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     134.00	  vs	 70.74</p>
<p>    Minorities    less  21.82	  vs less   8.56</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries     36.56	  vs	  nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Pernas International Holdings Bhd is in the hotel and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
